stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_bgte_cond\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 And so does Beauty, Good, Truth, Economy. Both, not either.</title><path d=\"M775.3793103448276,114 L694.1213577650947,179.45779513367378\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"718.4397660702723\" cy=\"126.48129593067156\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_when\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Settings and context are chosen, not given — which is already an ethical act.</title><path d=\"M526.9275250185794,201.7498752888717 Q353.7,183.10000000000002 169.76383951244287,345\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"352.7990566184655\" cy=\"198.29009734243152\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_why\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Purposes are where the crown bites hardest: an efficient answer to an ugly purpose still fails.</title><path d=\"M515.5856166152893,225.0477035149052 Q458.7,229.3 367.5680159256802,345\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"458.95035054052937\" cy=\"228.48528606430762\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_who\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Who is included, and on what standing, is a Good question before it is a design question.</title><path d=\"M601.1895421212415,249.21822365776234 Q563.7,275.5 554.5885167464115,345\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"554.3282924012118\" cy=\"261.2274045082323\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_hows\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Strategy chosen without the crown optimises the wrong thing well.</title><path d=\"M658.0157170923379,260.7367387033399 Q668.7,321.7 705.1886792452831,345\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"658.1950110138033\" cy=\"337.0327417517937\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_howm\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Mechanism is where 'true to the ecology it sits in' stops being abstract.</title><path d=\"M681.612058652202,254.0742422629077 Q773.7,367.9 877.5,374.29826795720834\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"773.3765931683637\" cy=\"370.8664113826676\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_c_what\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Outcomes are measured against the crown, not only against the plan.</title><path d=\"M691.6332103353961,251.24474061118224 Q878.7,414.1 1087.5,390.46880185861266\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B4C9A\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#mk6B4C9A)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"880.6605930073763\" cy=\"397.2767125536623\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_seq1\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Time and place before purpose. Marc's extension of Meadows — context precedes paradigm.</title><path d=\"M222.5,380 L247.5,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A635E\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk5A635E)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"406\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_seq2\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Purpose before people. Who you need depends on what it is for.</title><path d=\"M432.5,380 L457.5,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A635E\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk5A635E)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"406\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_seq3\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 People before strategy. Strategy without the stakeholders in the room produces a document.</title><path d=\"M642.5,380 L667.5,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A635E\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk5A635E)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"655\" cy=\"406\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_seq4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Strategy before mechanism. Deciding how to build precedes what to build with.</title><path d=\"M852.5,380 L877.5,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A635E\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk5A635E)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"865\" cy=\"406\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_seq5\" style=\"cursor: pointer; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 And What comes last. Answering What first is the standard failure — it produces solutions nobody will carry.</title><path d=\"M1062.5,380 L1087.5,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5A635E\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk5A635E)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"1075\" cy=\"406\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_p1_q\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Systemic Problem Solving runs the whole nested chain, in order, with stakeholders present. Two to four hours.</title><path d=\"M608.6626389560174,526 Q430.7,358.1 222.5,373.2632191553043\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"428.0296489785978\" cy=\"374.26685574979535\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"runs the chain\" href=\"/runs-the-chain.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(21.6,426.1,386.1)\"><tspan x=\"426.0740532827604\" y=\"386.10643536540766\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#0E5A4B\">runs the chain</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-e_p2_crown\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Walking the Tetrahedron is not one diagnostic among several — it is the governing model used as a check.</title><path d=\"M222.0486725663717,701 Q472.4,468.8 470.2647943831494,114\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"436.26513677751086\" cy=\"451.2539781288396\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"the crown, applied\" href=\"/the-crown-applied.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-67.1,425.5,446.0)\"><tspan x=\"425.4704287614586\" y=\"446.01238687730375\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#6B4C9A\">the crown, applied</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-e_p5_who\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Collective Action Assessment is the Who shelf applied to a real commons.</title><path d=\"M524.0461538461539,701 Q604.2,571 559.9319371727748,415\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"602.4602179647961\" cy=\"570.6364439889587\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_p3_why\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Leverage points are a Why question: where would a small push do the most?</title><path d=\"M715,715.5263157894736 Q500.8,665.6 359.70588235294116,415\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"508.80760176369705\" cy=\"643.6193481578687\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_p3_what\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 And SPC closes it on What: did anything actually change, or are we reading noise?</title><path d=\"M920.2857142857143,701 Q1079.2,639.2 1166.388888888889,415\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"1073.3889369430042\" cy=\"626.0426431609237\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_p4_what\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 The 15 Ps land on What through Product, Persuade, Purchase, Provide, Protect.</title><path d=\"M1162.5981308411215,701 Q1239.2,568.8 1190.9745762711864,415\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0E5A4B\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk0E5A4B)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"1237.5538799150297\" cy=\"568.5151568938745\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/></g><g id=\"edge-e_r1\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Routed to when the situation involves something held in common that is depletable and open to access.</title><path d=\"M568.7798165137615,604 Q536.5,619.5 511.81327800829877,701\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A5F10\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk8A5F10)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"534.9694838023357\" cy=\"606.1965874384464\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"commons\" href=\"/commons.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-59.6,536.3,618.1)\"><tspan x=\"536.3409997336074\" y=\"618.1179524630678\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#8A5F10\">commons</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-e_r2\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Cynefin says complex: cause and effect visible only in hindsight. Intervene without pretending to predict.</title><path d=\"M664.519615692554,604 Q696.5,689.9 723.8622754491018,701\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A5F10\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk8A5F10)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"697.194135507777\" cy=\"701.1429865935071\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"complex\" href=\"/complex.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(58.5,696.5,689.2)\"><tspan x=\"696.4546704188317\" y=\"689.1657919561043\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#8A5F10\">complex</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-e_r3\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Cynefin says complicated: expertise applies. Design and engineering tools.</title><path d=\"M691.236559139785,604 Q856.5,760.3 1035,747.5185185185185\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8A5F10\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#mk8A5F10)\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"857.4677507664629\" cy=\"747.9381216923219\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><a class=\"internal\" data-title=\"complicated\" href=\"/complicated.html\"><text text-anchor=\"middle\" pointer-events=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(22.7,858.4,736.0)\"><tspan x=\"858.4043063738562\" y=\"735.974724867245\" font-size=\"10\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#8A5F10\">complicated</tspan></text></a></g><g id=\"edge-e_p4_loop\" style=\"cursor: grab; opacity: 1;\"><title>📌 Posterity abstracts what is universal and writes it onto the shelf, where it becomes the input to someone else's Pathway 1. This is how the whole system grows.</tit